    "detailed_description": "<h1>COMIC GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>REVENGE ON THE STREETS 2</h1><p></p><br><h1>THE BEGINNING OF: REVENGE ON THE STREETS</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Neurotic beat 'em up, full of action, with different types of difficult enemies, the art style is very unique, all hand-drawn, the player controls one of the 5 playable characters to take down crime bosses and put an end to this <strong>REVENGE IN THE STREETS</strong><br><br>\u25cf This game is heavily inspired by the classic &quot;Street Of Rage 3&quot;<br><br>\u25cf Super tight control schemes designed for keyboards and controllers.<br><br>\u25cf Compatibility with PS4 and Xbox360 controllers, for one or two players<br><br>\u25cf Art style, hand-drawn.<br><br>\u25cf Hardcore difficulty with over 49 different enemies<br><br>\u25cf has 5 playable characters and 4 unlockable secret characters<br><br>STORY<br>\u25cf After Mr Romero's defeat, crime bosses appeared and kidnapped Sarah, Karina alone managed to save her daughter! and teaches Sarah how to fight to defend herself against criminals.<br><br>\u25cf \u200b3 years pass, in 2X23 the ex-crime boss's wife decides to take revenge for her husband's death, Sr. Jessi orders Karina and her family to be exterminated at all costs.<br><br>\u25cf Officer Christina finds out about Mrs. Jessi's plans and tells Sarah, who will soon gather the family and leave for the last fight.<br><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/17192687a9585e66a1ac51f21e3d6796.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/3b3b6a307cdb7749094b4811f97050d8.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/320c3e5e01b086c7f70e166935100ed7.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/f7520b02a62f07ba0739a1e789102bc7.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Neurotic beat 'em up, full of action, with different types of difficult enemies, the art style is very unique, all hand-drawn, the player controls one of the 5 playable characters to take down crime bosses and put an end to this <strong>REVENGE IN THE STREETS</strong><br><br>\u25cf This game is heavily inspired by the classic &quot;Street Of Rage 3&quot;<br><br>\u25cf Super tight control schemes designed for keyboards and controllers.<br><br>\u25cf Compatibility with PS4 and Xbox360 controllers, for one or two players<br><br>\u25cf Art style, hand-drawn.<br><br>\u25cf Hardcore difficulty with over 49 different enemies<br><br>\u25cf has 5 playable characters and 4 unlockable secret characters<br><br>STORY<br>\u25cf After Mr Romero's defeat, crime bosses appeared and kidnapped Sarah, Karina alone managed to save her daughter! and teaches Sarah how to fight to defend herself against criminals.<br><br>\u25cf \u200b3 years pass, in 2X23 the ex-crime boss's wife decides to take revenge for her husband's death, Sr. Jessi orders Karina and her family to be exterminated at all costs.<br><br>\u25cf Officer Christina finds out about Mrs. Jessi's plans and tells Sarah, who will soon gather the family and leave for the last fight.<br><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/17192687a9585e66a1ac51f21e3d6796.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/3b3b6a307cdb7749094b4811f97050d8.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787180/extras/320c3e5e01b086c7f70e166935100ed7.avif?t=1723232863\" /></div><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets